## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Existing (Image Mode)"
        Q1["Question + Image"] --> SA1["SignatureAgent"]
        SA1 --> AA1["APIAgent"]
        AA1 --> PA1["ProgramAgent"]
        PA1 --> E1["Engine"]
        E1 --> ML1["ModulesList (SAM2 Image)"]
    end
    
    subgraph "New (Video Mode)"
        Q2["Question + Video"] --> FE["Frame Extraction"]
        FE --> SA2["SignatureAgent (reused)"]
        SA2 --> AA2["APIAgent (reused)"]
        AA2 --> PA2["ProgramAgent + Video Prompt"]
        PA2 --> VE["VideoEngine"]
        VE --> VML["VideoModulesList"]
        VML --> SAM2V["SAM2 Video Predictor (track)"]
        VML --> GD["GroundingDINO (loc_frame)"]
        VML --> VQA["GPT-4o VQA (vqa_frame)"]
    end
```

